{"slug":"Deglaciated_Antarctica","title":"Deglaciated Antarctica","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Deglaciated_Antarctica_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"240\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"575\" data-file-height=\"460\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Height_Map\" title=\"Height Map\">Height map</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> consists of Antarctica without ice.\n</p><p>This leads to the landmass becoming a huge archipelago as the ice no longer connects the landmasses together, making it the map with the most islands in the entire game.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Deglaciated_Antarctica_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"512\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2300\" data-file-height=\"1840\"><figcaption>The Deglaciated Antarctica map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/deglaciatedantarctica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 9 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Penguin Empire, Norwegian Claim, Upper Australian Claim, Lower Australian Claim, Argentinian Claim and United Kingdom Claim.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Antarctica, Fictional</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 9</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 4</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 2300 x 1840.\n<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>","section":"Maps"}
